    </div>
    {% set collageWide = false %}{% set collageArt = false %}{% set collage2up = false %}{% set collageCredit = "" %}
    {% set collagePhotos = ["secondary-lab-preparing-sample", "secondary-lab-weighing", "secondary-lab-group-practical"] %}
    {% include "partials/collage.njk" %}
    <div class="center narrow mt">
      <p>Every practical starts the same way: goggles on, apron on, gloves on, bench clear. Then students prepare their own samples, weigh them, run the test and write up what the numbers actually say. The write-up is in English, and so is the argument about whose result is right. <strong>Art of Science</strong> in the afternoon picks up whatever the morning's lesson opened up.</p>
    </div>
