      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Executive Function</p>
      <h2>The habits that get work done</h2>
      <p>A timetabled class, late morning, alternating with History. It is about the part of school nobody teaches directly: planning a piece of work, breaking it up, keeping track of it, and finishing it.</p>
      <p>Some of it is routine — packing the right kit, knowing what a lesson needs before it starts. So one of last year's tasks was to make the reminders the classroom actually uses — what to put on before a practical, what to bring to sport — and they are still on the wall.</p>
